B. Same, randomized WITHIN class, class as fixed effect:
   residual var ~ (1-r^2)(1-ICC); clustering does not inflate, it slightly helps
   ICC=0.05: d=0.3,r=0.5: 254; d=0.3,r=0.7: 174; d=0.4,r=0.5: 144; d=0.4,r=0.7: 100; d=0.5,r=0.5: 94; d=0.5,r=0.7: 66
